<!DOCTYPE html>
{# The frame of every page served but the home page (0333): a page `extends` it and fills its
   blocks; the layout, its parts and their place are written here once.
   - on top, `page_header.html.j2` (the page's name, the theme, *Back to the home page*);
   - on the left, `#side`: the `side` block (tabs, a list, a form: what leads to the content),
     then the ⌨ panel (`#keys`) built from the `keys` block (the keys always in sight), the
     `more_keys` block (*More keys*) and the 🔒 line (`keys_safe`, set by the page: what is
     saved where, what nothing here deletes); no panel for a page without keys;
   - on the right, `#content`: one sticky bar (`#bar`, the `bar` block: where you are, the line
     read back from the disk, *Apply now*), then the `content` block (the page's `main`);
   - after them, the `after` block (dialogs, the page's script), then `home_link.html.j2`.
   Nothing else above the content: no second header, no footer; hints go in the keys panel or
   a `<details>`. The page sets `page_name` (and its `texts`) before its blocks; the look is
   `page_frame.css.j2`, the page's own rules go in the `style` block. #}
<html lang="{{ _('en') }}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ page_name }} — media-hygiene</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/images/favicon.png">
{% block head %}{% endblock %}
<style>
{% include "theme.css.j2" %}
{% include "page_frame.css.j2" %}
{% block style %}{% endblock %}
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% include "page_header.html.j2" %}
<div class="layout">
  <aside id="side">
{% block side %}{% endblock %}
{% if self.keys() | trim %}
  <section id="keys" aria-label="{{ _('Keyboard') }}">
    <h2>⌨ {{ _("Keyboard") }}</h2>
    <dl>
{% block keys %}{% endblock %}
    </dl>
{% if self.more_keys() | trim %}
    <details id="moreKeys">
    <summary>{{ _("More keys") }}</summary>
    <dl>
{% block more_keys %}{% endblock %}
    </dl>
    </details>
{% endif %}
{% if keys_safe is defined %}
    <p class="safe">🔒 {{ keys_safe }}</p>
{% endif %}
  </section>
{% endif %}
  </aside>
  <div id="content">
  <header id="bar">
{% block bar %}{% endblock %}
  </header>
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
  </div>
</div>
{% block after %}{% endblock %}
{% include "home_link.html.j2" %}
</body>
</html>
